# build/ holds only generated output: the composited slide pages (multi-megabyte
# HTML with the capture inlined as a base64 data URI) and the review sheet.
# It is already covered by the repo-wide **/build/ rule, which is exactly why
# the generators live in tools/ instead. Regenerate with:
#   node tools/render-all.js <platform>
#   node tools/make-review.js && node tools/make-review-page.js
